  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — Initial release of this package id. Contains what was Universal.Operative.Sdk's turn-based engine prior to its own 5.0.0: IOperative, Operative, OperativeBuilder, IOperativeFactory/OperativeFactory, IEngine/Engine/EngineBuilder, IModel, Conversation, Message, EngineEvent and its subtypes, StreamEvent/StreamEvents, the transformer pipeline, and AgentTool — unchanged in behavior, only the namespace changes, from Universal.Operative.Sdk to Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete. Split out because Universal.Operative.Sdk 5.0.0 is now a shared kernel (ITool, ToolResult, ToolDefinition, ToolChoice, Block, Usage, IDiagnosticSink) reused by both this package and the new Universal.Operative.Sdk.Realtime; see Universal.Operative.Sdk 5.0.0's own release notes for that history. A prior consumer of the pre-5.0.0 unified package should update `using Universal.Operative.Sdk;` to also add `using Universal.Operative.Sdk.Discrete;`, and add a package reference to this package alongside Universal.Operative.Sdk.",
